    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 39:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukama akangambira ati, “Iwe mwana w'omuntu, orangire Gogi ebilimugwera, oti, Omukama Ruhanga nagamba ati: Iwe Gogi, omukama rubamba wa Mesheki na Tubali nakunokeire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.39.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.39.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 39:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndikuhindura nkwihye owanyu kuli bikara, nkugobye omu Mabanga ga Isiraeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.39.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.39.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 39:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahanyuma nditera obuta bwawe obukuli omu mukono gwa bumosho mbukunagise, n'emyambi yawe ekuli omu mukono gwa bulyo ngigwise ahansi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.39.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.39.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 39:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oligwa omu mabanga ga Isiraeli, iwe n'emiigana yawe y'embwa n'amahanga ago oliba oinago. Ndikunagira amahungu ga buli ngeli n'ebikaka, bikulye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.39.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.39.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 39:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oligwa omw'ishwa, kuba alikugamba n'inye Omukama. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.39.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.39.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 39:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nditweka omuliro gwokye Magogi n'abatura omu nsi z'emyaro omu milembe; kandi balimanya okwo inye mba Mukama.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.39.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.39.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 39:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.39.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.39.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 39:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kandi eihanga lya Isiraeli ndilyemanyisa okwo mba mutakatifu. Tindikunda kushuba kujumwa; n'amahanga galimanya okwo mba Mukama, Omutakatifu wa Isiraeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.39.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.39.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 39:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Leba, ebi bilija mara bilibaho. Ekyo nikyo kiro ekyo nagambire. Alikugamba n'inye Ruhanga Omukama.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.39.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.39.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 39:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.39.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.39.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 39:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Aho abaliba batwire omu bigo bya Isiraeli balituruka bahembe ebikwato by'endashana: Engabo ezike n'ezihango, amata n'emyambi, ebikoni n'amachumu, bamare emyaka mushanju nibabihemba, bihye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.39.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.39.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 39:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tibalishenya nkwi mw'ishwa nangu n'okuraza ebibira. Kuba barahembaga ebikwato byabo by'endashana. Balinyaga ababanyagire; alikugamba n'inye Ruhanga Omukama.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.39.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.39.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 39:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.39.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.39.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 39:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kiro kilinya ndiha Gogi omwanya gw'okuzikwamu omuli Isiraeli, omu Ruhanga rw'Abagenzi oburugaizoba bw'enyanja. Muli nimwo baliziika Gogi n'abantube enkuyanja. Enziiko ezo zilitanga abagenzi, kandi halyetwa Ruhanga rwa Hamonigogi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.39.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.39.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 39:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abaisiraeli balimara emyezi mushanju nibabaziika, babone kushemeza ensi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.39.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.39.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 39:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abanyansi bona baliziika abantu abo, mara balibona ekitinwa kiro ekyo ndisinga endashana. Alikugamba n'inye Ruhanga Omukama. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.39.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.39.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 39:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Balitaho abantu ab'okwikara nibarambura ensi nibaziika emitumbi eliba esigairemu, ensi eshemere. K'emyezi egyo mushanju elikya balishuba bateho abarambuzi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.39.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.39.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 39:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abarambuzi abo orwo baliba nibarambura ensi, k'omurambuzi alibona eigufa ly'omuntu, alilitaho akamanyiso aha rubaju, kuhika orwo abaziiki baliliziika omu Ruhanga rwa Hamonigogi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.39.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.39.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 39:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "(Mwonene omwo halibamu ekigo kilikwetwa Hamona). Nikwo balishemeza batyo ensi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.39.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.39.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 39:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.39.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.39.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 39:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mbwenu iwe mwana w'omuntu, alikugamba n'inye Ruhanga Omukama, ogambire amahungu aga buli ngeli n'ebikaaka byona oti: Muhurure mwije, muruge buli rubaju mwije aha bugenyi bw'ebitambo obwo ndikubatekatekera, obugenyi buhango bw'ebitambo aha mabanga ga Isiraeli, mulye enyama, munywe n'obwamba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.39.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.39.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 39:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mulilya emitumbi y'abaisherukare, munywe n'obwamba bw'abatwazi, mulye n'empaya z'entama n'obwana bwazo, n'embuzi, n'enumi: Eshajwa zona za Bashani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.39.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.39.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 39:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mulilya ebishaju muhage, munywe n'obwamba mutamiire aha bugenyi bw'ebitambo obwo ndikubatekatekera. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.39.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.39.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 39:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi aha kiihuro kyange muliguta efarasi n'abakuubi bazo hamoi n'abaisherukare ab'engeli zona. Alikugamba n'inye Ruhanga Omukama.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.39.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.39.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 39:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.39.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.39.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 39:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Amahanga gona ndigoleka ekitinwa kyange, galibona n'ekibonabonyio ekyo nditaho n'obushobora bwange obwo ndibabonabonesa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.39.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.39.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 39:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eihanga lya Isiraeli lilimanya okwo mba Mukama Ruhanga wabo, kwema kir'ekyo n'amakiro agalihonderaho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.39.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.39.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 39:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amahanga galimanya okwo eihanga lya Isiraeli lyagiire omu buzahe aha rw'entambara zabo, aha rw'okuba bakangobeza nabesheleka, namara nabaanaga omu mikono y'ababisha babo bagwa aha mbanda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.39.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.39.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 39:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkabatwaza kuhonderana n'okuburwa obugorogoki kwabo n'entambara zabo, nabesheleka.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.39.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.39.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 39:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.39.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.39.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 39:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukama Ruhanga akagamba ati, “Mbwenu naija kugarulira baijukuru ba Yakobo, eihanga lya Isiraeli, bashube baramuuke. Kandi obutakatifu bwange nibwija kumbubisa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.39.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.39.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 39:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enshoni ezabaire zibakwete balizebwa, n'obugobya bwona obwo babaire bangobeize, orwo baliba batwirege omu nsi yabo hataliho wa kubatinisa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.39.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.39.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 39:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho ndiba nabagarwire kuruga omu mahanga n'omu nsi z'ababisha babo, nkabolekeraho amahanga okwo mba mutakatifu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.39.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.39.27"
            ]
          }
